foot: foot (A Wayland terminal emulator)
foot: foot is a minimalist, portable, and fast Wayland terminal emulator
foot: for Linux and macOS. It renders text with fcft, supports the sixel
foot: and kitty image protocols, OSC 99 notifications, and a small memory
foot: footprint with quick startup. It is configured through a single
foot: foot.ini file under /etc/xdg/foot/ (or ~/.config/foot/foot.ini).
